3. Checkpoints (Hugging Face model repository ChenyuanC/MemorybeforeGoal)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

  The released checkpoints are under the Apache License 2.0. They are fine-tuned from the Psi0 checkpoints published
  by the Psi0 authors (USC-PSI-Lab/psi-model on the Hugging Face Hub; the Psi0 project is under the Apache License 2.0),
  whose backbone is Qwen3-VL-2B (Apache License 2.0); vlm/ holds the Qwen3-VL configuration, tokenizer and processor
  files. Fine-tuning data: the HuMeGo datasets (ChenyuanC/HuMeGo-*, CC BY 4.0) and, for the SIMPLE tasks, the Psi0
  SIMPLE data (USC-PSI-Lab/psi-data). For the data the Psi0 checkpoints were pre-trained on, see the Psi0 repository.
